nguage":"en-US","title":"Four Minutes","overview":"Jenny is young. Her life is over. She killed someone. And she would do it again. When an 80-year-old piano teacher discovers the girl’s secret, her brutality and her dreams, she decides to transform her pupil into the musical wunderkind she once was."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"In einem Frauengefängnis kreuzen sich die Schicksale der über 80-jährigen Traude Krüger und der 21-jährigen Jenny. Erstere ist eine altgediente Klavierlehrerin, die Jüngere ein neuer aufsässiger Häftling. Obwohl Jenny die alte Dame vor den Kopf stößt, wo sie nur kann, fördert Traude ihr Talent nach Kräften. Für die gemeinsame Chance eines Klavierwettbewerbs müssen beide sich öffnen und dunkle Geheimnisse preisgeben."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fOYnMQkdsDsr7JDv6TtwdPz8TPv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xzFUKyogQNR8UwfNF4V47v92B29.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1294,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fOYnMQkdsDsr7JDv6TtwdPz8TPv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fOYnMQkdsDsr7JDv6TtwdPz8TPv.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fOYnMQkdsDsr7JDv6TtwdPz8TPv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fOYnMQkdsDsr7JDv6TtwdPz8TPv.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tP4TEJf77KRVVNlzGFTVEyxInQC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tP4TEJf77KRVVNlzGFTVEyxInQC.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qZusVWgu0Df9hD4JbT0R2yYL2ya.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/